  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [eslint](https://github.com/eslint/eslint) from `v4.10.0` to `v4.11.0`\n\n\n### Commits\n\n<details>\n<summary>eslint/eslint</summary>\n\n#### 4.11.0\n-   [`1a9a6a5`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/1a9a6a50fb0d873b2263c066437dd1b7da6ed4ac) 4.11.0\n-   [`ef4d268`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/ef4d26854a9f31be9e294d1ef3e73479ba204fee) Build: changelog update for 4.11.0\n-   [`d4557a6`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/d4557a6233d500bc309b08d7b6571a620ce30080) Docs: disallow use of the comma operator using no-restricted-syntax (#&#8203;9585)\n-   [`d602f9e`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/d602f9ea09ed37fde3a57e358fe200802b2b399e) Upgrade: espree v3.5.2 (#&#8203;9611)\n-   [`4def876`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/4def8764273e7cc53c71f0dd67da271636e4c1be) Chore: avoid handling rules instances in config-validator (#&#8203;9364)\n-   [`fe5ac7e`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/fe5ac7ecc27fcb8cd6df77f28c2275b9c8878008) Chore: fix incorrect comment in safe-emitter.js (#&#8203;9605)\n-   [`6672fae`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/6672faec22e0015ee57b9e1b3b895e9269233c73) Docs: Fixed a typo on lines-between-class-members doc (#&#8203;9603)\n-   [`980ecd3`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/980ecd3669da627de63fccacf3b7f4af3b4f45e6) Chore: Update copyright and license info (#&#8203;9599)\n-   [`cc2c7c9`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/cc2c7c9380368658add0daccad73c2cc7fd94509) Build: use Node 8 in appveyor (#&#8203;9595)\n-   [`2542f04`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/2542f043cd9ec953cbe43ee9391d75c42a512522) Docs: Add missing options for `lines-around-comment` (#&#8203;9589)\n-   [`b6a7490`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/b6a749090d2231ab5fe598b094eef08e4ecfb2c4) Build: ensure fuzzer tests get run with `npm test` (#&#8203;9590)\n-   [`1073bc5`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/1073bc5a5af087c89d63e4a07f8ee690817d6dc8) Build: remove shelljs-nodecli (refs #&#8203;9533) (#&#8203;9588)\n-   [`7e3bf6a`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/7e3bf6aba2841a548c0a9b35b05ebeca06eba16c) Fix: edge-cases of semi-style (#&#8203;9560)\n-   [`e5a37ce`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/e5a37ce3b6cf8a2838fb71c5b2f1db0e4a978603) Fix: object-curly-newline for flow code (#&#8203;9458)\n-   [`9064b9c`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/9064b9c1849feb87b05a22f751bc2b45317417ef) Chore: add equalTokens in ast-utils. (#&#8203;9500)\n-   [`b7c5b19`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/b7c5b19d652b92716712e74e58e76f3a6b934d14) Fix: Correct [object Object] output of error.data. (#&#8203;9561)\n-   [`51c8cf0`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/51c8cf057a56f87d0b6416006da672ea8cb48315) Docs: Disambiguate definition of Update tag (#&#8203;9584)\n-   [`afc3c75`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/afc3c75f69439952baa8596edbd5a47d56484f8b) Docs: clarify what eslint-config-eslint is (#&#8203;9582)\n-   [`aedae9d`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/aedae9dfe027bf1e068680db678a070ebe737e56) Docs: fix spelling in valid-typeof example (#&#8203;9574)\n-   [`4c5aaf3`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/4c5aaf3683fcb19231390b5d79e8770071ed39d9) Docs: Fix typo in no-underscore-dangle rule (#&#8203;9567)\n-   [`3623600`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/3623600266fd007bcaab341f7f9183f0ad323cc5) Chore: upgrade ajv@&#8203;5.3.0 (#&#8203;9557)\n-   [`1b606cd`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/1b606cdd074d698978c83e2a7acf49180a1d8df0) Chore: Remove an indirect dependency on jsonify (#&#8203;9444)\n-   [`4d7d7ab`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/4d7d7ab79551fa1bb2ff3d355d1bfff69d870faf) Update: Resolve npm installed formatters (#&#8203;5900) (#&#8203;9464)\n-   [`accc490`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/accc49039c5b436a2396141a32cf49421ac4158f) Fix: Files with no failures get &quot;passing&quot; testcase (#&#8203;9547)\n-   [`ab0f66d`](https://github.com/eslint/eslint